Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.28,0:00:05.13,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now raise your hands up! Sing your dreams out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.21,0:00:08.80,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Always stand up! Raise our unyielding flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.91,0:00:12.36,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,So many obstacles are already behind us!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.43,0:00:17.78,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now let's keep moving forward! Hands up!!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.39,0:00:30.76,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,"I'm almost there, just a little further and I'll have the answer."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.22,0:00:27.49,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(206,574)}Translation\N{\fs40}Hattori
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.63,0:00:30.76,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(762,370)}Initial timing\N{\fs40}Hattori
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.79,0:00:38.43,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,That's what I believed as I sailed into this new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.19,0:00:34.35,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(226,424)}Timing\N{\fs40}Galaxy 9000
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.86,0:00:38.43,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(792,492)}Quality checking\N{\fs40}Sewil
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.48,0:00:45.96,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,That's right, the pieces of our dreams are joined together as one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.43,0:00:43.68,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(200,500)}Soundtracking\N{\fs40}MaideV and Halee
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.73,0:00:45.96,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(198,488)}Raw providing\N{\fs40}OPC-Raws
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.00,0:00:54.01,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,We're connected by unwavering bonds, let's head for a bright future!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.00,0:00:48.22,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(858,345)}Editing\N{\fs40}Sewil
