Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.53,0:01:05.83,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,So many obstacles are already behind us!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.91,0:01:09.88,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now let's keep moving forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.97,0:01:11.37,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Always look up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.40,0:01:13.60,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Keep your head held high!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.63,0:01:15.03,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Always step up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.07,0:01:16.88,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Fly over the waves!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.97,0:01:20.50,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Our dreams have been carefully joined together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.53,0:01:24.74,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now let's head for the future!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.99,0:01:31.13,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,We drift forward, riding the waves,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.17,0:01:35.38,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,meeting people and saying goodbye, then doing it again,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.39,0:01:39.62,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,all under this flag...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.34,0:01:44.72,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Pain I don't want to forget is kept in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.83,0:01:48.28,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,There was a day when I softly carved it there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.35,0:01:51.91,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,I won't let anyone take my freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.94,0:01:54.82,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,I grasp it tightly in my hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.85,0:01:59.78,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now raise your hands up! Sing your dreams out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.81,0:02:03.46,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Always stand up! Raise our unyielding flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.51,0:02:06.75,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,So many obstacles are already behind us!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.79,0:02:10.91,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now let's keep moving forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.95,0:02:12.27,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Always look up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.32,0:02:14.58,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Keep your head held high!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.61,0:02:15.97,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Always step up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.01,0:02:17.79,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Fly over the waves!
